    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69451" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύσπαλα</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mousetrap</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυσπαλοίματα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κατάλοιπα τῶν ἀλουμένων</span>, Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύσπαν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύξαν, οἱ δὲ τὸ μυὸς τρόπον
				ἀναστρέφεσθαι</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυσπίην:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυχοισμόν</span> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοιχισμόν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
				μύσαγμα</span>, Id.</div>
